      "review_description": "We received two quotes after talking about the size of the system we wanted. Not much difference in cost between the two but using the same brand inverter and panels. The process was very good. Representatives from both companies were polite, knowledgeable and there was no pressure to sign up.Installation was done when said it would be. Installers were quick, friendly, knowledgeable and tidy. No mess left.Plenty of information given about shutting down the system and bringing it up again.The app was explained to us and the installation included organizing for the power meter to be changed to a smart meter which took a couple of weeks.Since then, we have received from Solar Quotes, a list of power providers in our area and the various prices for peak, off peak and solar. That is very helpful.",
