      "review_date": "2025-01-07",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "A professional and seamless process from start to finish. We appreciated Bree's prompt site visit after our initial enquiry, where lots of solar information was shared with us and we were able to ask lots of questions. Jacob's visit with his team just 3 weeks later was very smooth, thanks to his knowledge, experience and expertise. As well as the installation of a new solar battery and inverter, we also had 9 obsolete solar panels removed and 9 new ones installed to supplement the existing 20 solar panels. The work was carried out in a timely, cost efficient and skilful manner with excellent customer service demonstrated by all personnel. Clean Energy Solutions also organised all the paperwork, the NSW Government rebate, the grid connection and showed us how to install the iSolarCloud app on our phones. We are delighted that we supported a local company who have a showroom very close to where we live so we can pop in at any time with questions etc. Clean Energy Solutions also carry out ongoing monitoring of the system to ensure everything is working like it should! I recommend Clean Energy Solutions for all solar energy installations.",
